# Knock

> Knock is customer engagement you build, run, and improve with agents. One platform for lifecycle, promotional, and transactional messaging across email, in-app, push, SMS, and chat.

"Your agent" is Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, or another client you connect to Knock. "Agent steps" run inside Knock workflows. "The Knock agent" works in the Knock dashboard.

## Start with an agent
