## Pricing
- [Pricing](https://knock.app/pricing): The Developer plan is free and includes 10K messages per month. The Starter plan starts at $250 per month and includes 50K messages, then $.005 per message. Enterprise has volume-based pricing through sales.

## Product
- [Workflows](https://knock.app/features/workflows): Orchestrate your entire customer journey. A single workflow engine for powering transactional and lifecycle messaging across every channel.
- [Guides](https://knock.app/features/guides): In-app messaging with your own components. Ship paywalls, dialogs, and nudges powered by your components. Enable non-engineers to edit copy and targeting in Knock.
- [Broadcasts](https://knock.app/features/broadcasts): Intelligent, multi-channel announcements. Send one-time announcements across every channel, with complete control over audience, content, and delivery.
- [Data activation](https://knock.app/features/data-activation): Unify and activate your data. Ingest from your product and warehouse, build audiences, and trigger relevant messaging.
- [Observability](https://knock.app/features/observability): See every workflow run, message, and log across channels.
- [Template management](https://knock.app/features/template-management): Manage templates, layouts, partials, and translations in one place, with version control.
- [Preferences](https://knock.app/features/preferences): Enable recipients to choose which messages they get and on which channels.

