- [Understanding notification channels](https://knock.app/manuals/notification-infrastructure/understanding-notification-channels): Why cross-channel support matters, and why you want to avoid setting up and managing notifications across different channels by yourself.
- [How to choose a notification infrastructure platform](https://knock.app/manuals/notification-infrastructure/how-to-choose-a-notification-infrastructure-platform): Learn when you might need a more comprehensive notification solution, what criteria to look for, and how to choose the right notification platform for your product.

#### Transactional email

- [Introduction to transactional email](https://knock.app/manuals/transactional-email/introduction-to-transactional-email): Learn what "transactional" means, see real-world examples of transactional emails, and understand why deliverability is critical for this type of communication.
- [How to build a transactional email system](https://knock.app/manuals/transactional-email/how-to-build-a-transactional-email-system): This chapter discusses how to approach building your own transactional email infrastructure (spoiler: don't), how to choose the right email service provider, and how to set up authentication for your email domains with SPF, DKIM, DMARC, and BIMI.
- [Best practices for sending transactional email](https://knock.app/manuals/transactional-email/best-practices-for-sending-transactional-email): This chapter covers best practices for managing email deliverability and discusses how localization, template management, and personalization issues can be solved with notification infrastructure. 
- [How to measure transactional email performance](https://knock.app/manuals/transactional-email/how-to-measure-transactional-email-performance): This chapter addresses all of the different metrics you should monitor to make sure your transactional emails are sending successfully over time, including things like delivery rate, bounce rate, time to inbox, and more.

#### Push notifications

- [Introduction to push notifications](https://knock.app/manuals/push-notifications/introduction-to-push-notifications): Learn what push notifications are, how they work, and real-world examples of effective push notifications.
- [Core components of a push notification system](https://knock.app/manuals/push-notifications/core-components-of-push-notification-systems): This chapter explains the fundamental building blocks required to send your first push notification, including token management, provider authentication, payload structure, and the sending pipeline.
- [The technical implementation of push notifications](https://knock.app/manuals/push-notifications/technical-implementation-of-push-notifications): This chapter explains the critical technical components and architectural decisions that will enable you to scale billions of push notifications sending to millions of users reliably.
- [Building a robust preference system](https://knock.app/manuals/push-notifications/building-a-preference-system): How to navigate the complexity of push notification preferences, with a focus on how your application’s preference logic interacts with the device’s native controls that users rely on to manage their experience.
- [Deciding how to deliver your push notifications](https://knock.app/manuals/push-notifications/delivering-push-notifications): This chapter will help you decide whether or not to build your own infrastructure (spoiler: don't) and how to choose the right push notification provider.

#### SMS notifications

- [Introduction to SMS notifications](https://knock.app/manuals/sms-notifications/introduction-to-sms-notifications): Learn what SMS notifications are, how transactional and promotional SMS differ, how SMS delivery works, and the top use cases for SMS notifications, from authentication codes to shipping updates.
- [How to build an SMS notification system](https://knock.app/manuals/sms-notifications/how-to-build-an-sms-notification-system): The building blocks required to send your first SMS notification, including sending identities, rate limits, location-specific considerations, user preference management, and more.
- [Best practices for sending SMS notifications](https://knock.app/manuals/sms-notifications/best-practices-for-sending-sms-notifications): Best practices for sending your first SMS notification, including tips for writing effective, well-formatted content that drives action and strategies to reduce your costs when sending at scale.
- [How to choose an SMS provider](https://knock.app/manuals/sms-notifications/how-to-choose-an-sms-notification-system): Learn how to evaluate SMS providers on pricing, developer experience, and advanced features, and compare the top SMS providers, including Twilio, Amazon SNS, Sinch, and Vonage.

#### In-app messaging

- [Introduction to in-app messaging](https://knock.app/manuals/in-app-messaging/introduction-to-in-app-messaging): Learn what in-app messaging is, what it takes to use it well, and real-world use cases and examples of effective in-app messages.
- [How to build an in-app messaging system](https://knock.app/manuals/in-app-messaging/how-to-build-in-app-messaging-system): Learn how in-app messaging works, including the backend architecture, real-time delivery infrastructure, storage and state management, UI components, and more.
- [Best practices for in-app messaging](https://knock.app/manuals/in-app-messaging/best-practices-for-in-app-messaging): Best practices for sending your first in-app message, including tips for choosing the right format, writing actionable content, targeting the right users, and more.
- [How to choose an in-app messaging solution](https://knock.app/manuals/in-app-messaging/how-to-choose-an-in-app-messaging-solution): Learn how to choose the right in-app messaging solution, considering flexibility and customization, performance and reliability, developer experience, cost structure, and more.

#### Slack notifications

- [Introduction to Slack notifications](https://knock.app/manuals/slack-notifications/introduction-to-slack-notifications): Learn what Slack notifications are, why they matter for modern product experiences, and real-world examples of teams using Slack to deliver timely, contextual updates to users.
- [How to send Slack notifications](https://knock.app/manuals/slack-notifications/how-to-send-slack-notifications): The technical details of how Slack notifications work under the hood. Learn how to authenticate and send messages through the Slack API, handle delivery logic, manage message state, and build a robust backend workflow that ensures every message reaches the right destination.
- [Best practices for sending Slack notifications](https://knock.app/manuals/slack-notifications/best-practices-for-slack-notifications): Once you’re set up to send notifications, this chapter helps you optimize them for impact. We’ll walk through best practices for message design, formatting, interactivity, and targeting, so your Slack messages feel useful, not noisy.
- [Deciding how to deliver your Slack notifications](https://knock.app/manuals/slack-notifications/delivering-slack-notifications): The choice between building your own Slack notification system and using a managed service is one of the most critical decisions you'll make. Let's examine when each approach makes sense.

#### Liquid templating language

- [An introduction to Liquid](https://knock.app/manuals/liquid-templating-language/introduction-to-liquid): In this chapter, you'll learn what Liquid is, how it works, and get introduced to Liquid's three core components through real-world examples.
- [Understanding Liquid keys](https://knock.app/manuals/liquid-templating-language/understanding-liquid-keys): Learn how Liquid keys work, including how to access simple and nested data, work with arrays by index, and apply best practices for defensive templating.
- [Understanding Liquid operators](https://knock.app/manuals/liquid-templating-language/understanding-liquid-operators): Learn how Liquid operators define how values are compared and combined, including the rules for truthy and falsy values, comparison operators, and logical operators that form the foundation for conditional expressions.
- [Understanding Liquid filters](https://knock.app/manuals/liquid-templating-language/understanding-liquid-filters): In this chapter, you'll learn how to use Liquid filters to modify strings, numbers, arrays, and dates efficiently, turning raw input into precisely formatted output through filter chaining and transformations.
- [Understanding Liquid tags](https://knock.app/manuals/liquid-templating-language/understanding-liquid-tags): Learn how Liquid tags enable control flow, iteration, and variable assignment, so you can build dynamic, data-driven templates with loops, conditions, and logic that respond to different inputs.
- [Advanced Liquid concepts](https://knock.app/manuals/liquid-templating-language/advanced-liquid-concepts): In this final chapter, we'll go beyond the basics with advanced concepts like date and time handling, whitespace control, and data encoding to power sophisticated dynamic personalization inside Knock.

#### Effective product messaging

- [The product leader's guide to effective messaging](https://knock.app/manuals/product-leaders-guide-to-effective-notifications/the-product-leaders-guide-to-effective-notifications): Learn how to build an effective product notification strategy using behavioral data, event-based triggers, cross-channel orchestration, batching, personalization, and user preferences.
